OL,3,GNEWSABeauty salon first in Wales
OL,4,Aprosecuted over unlawful laser
OL,5,Atreatments
OL,6,
OL,7,FA beauty salon has become the first in
OL,8,FWales to be prosecuted for providing
OL,9,Flaser hair removal and tattoo removal
OL,10,Ftreatments unlawfully.
OL,12,FBridgend-based firm "Fake It - Beauty
OL,13,Fand Aesthetics" failed to register
OL,14,Flaser services with Healthcare
OL,15,FInspectorate Wales (HIW).
OL,17,FThe owner Lady Helen Mary
OL,18,FMorgan-Wooldridge was given a fine and
OL,19,Fcosts totalling #8,950.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
